{"script":"s_5_6_0","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_40"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"gamePause\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"pause\": false\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]报纸……档案……全都找遍了，只要把这些传说弄清楚了，那怪异研究社就不会被废除了！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0.4,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]怪异……什么社？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]来得正好，三位是契约者吗？可以一起来拯救我们怪异研究社吗？我会付你们报酬的！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]啊？怪异研究社？那是什么？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我从头开始向你们介绍吧。怪异研究社是由我在大书院创立的社团，专门调查大书院乃至整个霜烬平原的奇闻轶事。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_7"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]虽说这个社团目前只有我一个人……不过我迟早会把它发展壮大！当然这都是后话了，现在怪异研究社正面临着前所未有的废社危机！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那群大书院的老爷们居然认为这个社团没有存在的意义，想要废除这个社团，但我怎能让他们轻易得逞！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]现在要让社团存在下去需要满足两个条件，第一个是找到一位顾问老师，第二个要取得能被学校认可的成果……无论是获得知名度还是创造收益都可以！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]噢，我算是听懂了，你不想让社团被废掉，可我们又能帮上什么忙呢？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]关于这点请你们放心，我已经想到办法找到外援了！只要满足她的要求，上面的问题都能解决。你们只需要协助我一起调查就好！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]调查？这和那两个条件有什么关系吗……[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哈喽，普普罗，你那些传闻都准备好了吗？[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"？？？"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_34"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"npcDisplay\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"display\": true,\r    \"uid\": \"pyy_c5_area1_1\",\r    \"heroType\": 0\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_36"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"npcMove\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"speed\": 3,\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"points\": [\r      {\r        \"y\": -30.80,\r        \"x\": 4.90\r      }\r    ],\r    \"lockDirection\": 0,\r    \"direction\": 3,\r    \"npc\": \"pyy_c5_area1_1\",\r    \"lockAnim\": \"walk_back\"\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_37"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"cameraTarget\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"heroType\": 0,\r    \"zoom\": 0.8,\r    \"npc\": \"pyy_c5_area1_1\"\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_38"}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":1500,"type":"time"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]来得正好，向两位契约者介绍一下，她叫普雅雅，是我请来的帮手。普雅雅，这两位就是我找到的契约者，稍后她们会协助我进行调查。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你们好呀，我是新闻社的普雅雅。说起来为什么要叫我“帮手”啊，明明是你有求于我嘛。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎呀，同学之间不是要互相帮助吗？虽然咱们算是一种交易，不过表面功夫还是得做一下的，不是吗？[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯……这个回答倒还让我比较满意。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]向几位契约者解释一下，相比这个快被取缔的怪异研究社，我们新闻社手里掌握的资源要优渥得多。普普罗向我提出的条件，我都可以满足。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_19"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]只是我们新闻社最近也比较缺选题，我想着怪异研究社应该会有些有趣的内容可以报道。所以只要怪异研究社能提供一些素材，我们就愿意帮忙。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_20"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara1"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0.4,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]噢，这下我懂了。只要我们能够帮普普罗把那些怪闻调查清楚并呈报给你，你就会出手相助。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_21"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]没错～所以我就是个收货的，具体要做什么，你们还得听那家伙的安排。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_22"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]放心吧，我早就做好准备了。经过精挑细选，每个话题都必定能引发爆炸性舆论。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_23"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]我打算调查以下四个传闻：旧街的午夜哀嚎、雪地中的神秘赤影、被冰封的雪怪足迹、永眠洞窟的燃烧传说。[l]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_24"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"text":"……这些都是什么东西？","tag":"tag_25"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_25"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[cm][show]都是霜烬平原本地流传的怪异传说，比如第一个旧街半夜的哀嚎，就是从旧街来的怪异传言。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_26"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]相传旧街曾是一片乱坟岗，有许多因战乱而被害的人长眠于此。在大兽潮发生以后，旧街的怨灵变得更加活跃，越来越多诡异的事件在旧街发生！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_27"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]其中最著名的就是半夜哀嚎事件。据传每当夜幕降临之时，被黑暗笼罩的旧街就会响起凄厉的哀嚎声，但无论护卫队如何搜寻都找不到声音的来源。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_28"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]据说这些声音正是那些怨灵的哀嚎，它们将自己悲惨的遭遇化作凄厉的惨叫，在旧街的每个角落久久回荡。而新街的建立，据说就是为了避开这些怨灵的侵扰。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_29"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara3"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]这种事情在黑森林那边不算少见……这里居然也有怨灵作祟吗……[l][cm]","charaName":"艾薇杜尔"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_30"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]有意思吧？事不宜迟，我们这就去旧街看看。我们直接去找那里的老住户皮皮科，他在旧街住了很多年，一定听说过这些传说！[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_31"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]还挺有干劲的嘛……那你们就好好去调查一番吧。调查完了就来本院找我吧，我就在那里等你们。[l][cm]","charaName":"文艺系学生普雅雅"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_32"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[show]好嘞好嘞，放心吧，一定能给你带来有趣的素材。那么几位契约者，我们一起出发吧！[l][cm][hide]","charaName":"文艺系学生普普罗"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_41"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":1,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_42"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"action\": \"npcDisplay\",\r  \"para\": {\r    \"display\": false,\r    \"uid\": \"pyy_c5_area1_1\",\r    \"heroType\": 0\r  }\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara1","img":"chara002_2","addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2a","x":50,"y":-180,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"chara3","img":"chara053_1","addImg":"chara053_1_face_chara053_1c","x":510,"y":-416,"trans":true,"scaleX":1,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":0.6,"scaleY":1}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"bg","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_33"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"alpha":0,"mirrow":false,"layer":"fore","img":"bgblack","addImg":"","x":-500,"y":-125,"trans":true,"scaleX":1.5,"noOut":false,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"nameSide":"left","text":"[hide]","charaName":""}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}],"des":"霜烬平原的怪异调查-接取步骤"}